use the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#tng-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"tng-case-study","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T19:47:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:46+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"TNG FinTech Group securely migrated targeted workloads to AWS to reduce analytics processing time through automation.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tng-logo.c86161a3a1919fee930699c9e0d941d760b633e4.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/tng/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"TNG FinTech Group","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"TNG Management Saves 30–40% of Its Time With AWS as a Single-Source Provider"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category