g-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#siemens-innovator-de","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"siemens-innovator-de","dateCreated":"2024-09-18T20:04:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-18T20:08:09+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Die Siemens AG ist ein weltweit führendes Unternehmen in den Bereichen Elektrifizierung, Automatisierung und Digitalisierung. Seit fast 175 Jahren treibt Siemens Innovationen in verschiedenen Branchen voran. Das Unternehmen setzt zahlreiche AWS-Services ein, um diese Tradition des Wandels fortzuführen: Beispielsweise bringt es das industrielle Internet der Dinge (Industrial Internet of Things, IIoT) in Eisenbahnen und Fabriken, entwickelt intelligente Infrastruktur für Gebäude sowie verteilte Energiesysteme und implementiert AI in seine Cybersicherheit-Plattform.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Siemens_Customer-Reference_Logo%401x.bb038521df5899223d4bd8364182c2fc69ef288d.png","displayLocation":"Nordamerika","customerNameLower":"siemens","industry":"Biowissenschaften","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/de/solutions/case-studies/siemens/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Kundengeschichte","customer-name":"Siemens","headline":"Siemens on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category