ame":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#innovator-hub","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Item in Innovator Hub","description":"\u003cp\u003eItems with this tag are being displayed in an Innovator-specific prefiltered Directory.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-14T22:12:04+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#siemens-innovator-de-it","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"siemens-innovator-de-it","dateCreated":"2024-11-12T00:53:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-12T01:13:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Siemens AG, leader globale nell\u0027elettrificazione, nell\u0027automazione e nella digitalizzazione, guida l\u0027innovazione in vari settori da oltre 175 anni. Siemens utilizza una gamma di tecnologie Amazon Web Services (AWS) per portare avanti la tradizione della trasformazione, portando l\u0027Internet delle cose industriale (IIoT) a ferrovie e fabbriche, sviluppando infrastrutture intelligenti per edifici e sistemi di energia distribuiti, implementando l\u0027intelligenza artificiale (IA) sulla piattaforma di cybersecurity e molto altro. Dalla modernizzazione dell\u0027infrastruttura di dati e delle funzionalità di analisi con AWS Glue e Amazon Athena all\u0027utilizzo di Amazon Neptune e AWS Lambda per creare Building Twin di Siemens. Ogni passaggio intrapreso dall\u0027organizzazione nel cloud AWS apporta nuova efficienza, valore e informazioni per migliorare le operazioni per Siemens e i suoi clienti.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Siemens_Customer-Reference_Logo%401x.bb038521df5899223d4bd8364182c2fc69ef288d.png","displayLocation":"North America","customerNameLower":"siemens","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/innovators/siemens/","customer-name":"Siemens","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Storia del cliente","headline":"Siemens su AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#produc