"additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Junelight is one of relatively few Siemens products aimed at individual consumers—an important new segment for Siemens. The company has traditionally focused on business-to-business sales but is increasingly targeting “behind the meter” devices and services like the Junelight system. By using AWS, the SDI team was able to bring Junelight from an idea on a whiteboard to a product in the marketplace in less than two years.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Siemens_Customer-Reference_Logo%401x.bb038521df5899223d4bd8364182c2fc69ef288d.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Electronics \u0026 Semiconductors","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/siemens-junelight-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Siemens","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Siemens Builds the Junelight Smart Battery in a Startup-like Environment on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#global","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Global","des